lore a hand-crafted world:</strong> Along the way, encounter survivors, lost souls, monstrous entities, and remnants of the world Blaise once ruled. Discover hidden paths and forgotten places as you slowly uncover what truly happened during the Great Collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/8d80214294e8434cfe11d2f3366f4db7.poster.avif?t=1788252587\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/8d80214294e8434cfe11d2f3366f4db7.webm?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/8d80214294e8434cfe11d2f3366f4db7.mp4?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Combat:</strong> Strike down the enemies of humanity with Erinyes, an iron blade born from the blood of the massacred citizens of Caerwyn. Strike. Parry. Dodge. Survive. Every strike matters. Every mistake can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/2cec691b626c65b2923a08549d139bd4.poster.avif?t=1788252587\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/2cec691b626c65b2923a08549d139bd4.webm?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/2cec691b626c65b2923a08549d139bd4.mp4?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Survive:</strong> Blood is power. Right is inheritance. Strengthen Blaise throughout his journey by acquiring new Erinyes perks and reinforcing his Iron Backbone. Discover phoenix shards scattered throughout the world and use them to unlock the power of the Phoenix Crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/81e84cec53884e0955f169912b48514d.poster.avif?t=1788252587\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/81e84cec53884e0955f169912b48514d.webm?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/81e84cec53884e0955f169912b48514d.mp4?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Risky Bets:</strong> Play the Devil's Advocate, a dangerous game that offers powerful advantages at a cost. Accept the Devil's bargains and gain new strengths - but beware the consequences. The path to victory is rarely without sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/8f6951f9833e0e3d9ad869794a6cb85c.poster.avif?t=1788252587\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/8f6951f9833e0e3d9ad869794a6cb85c.webm?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/8f6951f9833e0e3d9ad869794a6cb85c.mp4?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery:</strong> What happened to Caerwyn? What is the Legion of Asgarand? What does Death want? And why was Blaise condemned to live and suffer forever? Discover the truth through lost journals, hopeless souls, forgotten survivors, and other entities scattered throughout the world. Piece together the events of the Great Collapse and uncover the history of Blaise Vaelthorne, his family, and the dukedom he failed to save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/ec217ab1af4cb80c47960f1e3a79af02.poster.avif?t=1788252587\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/ec217ab1af4cb80c47960f1e3a79af02.webm?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/extras/ec217ab1af4cb80c47960f1e3a79af02.mp4?t=1788252587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Blood and Ruin:</strong> Wander through a dark gothic world shaped by Transylvanian, Moldavian, Slavic, and Latin influences. Discover a world where folklore, faith, death, and forgotten history intertwine.</p>", "short_description": "Embark as Blaise Vaelthorne, the 35th Duke of Caerwyn and Warden of the White City, on a harrowing journey to reclaim the Phoenix Throne from the daemon host. Endure betrayal, suffering, and impossible odds as you fight to restore your dukedom’s destiny. By Right. By Blood.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/6dba46cb626157ce0683f098c7d4d1e08dee559f/header.jpg?t=1788252587", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/47a8bbcaa009eec69540e96a2b9e4540a294a618/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788252587", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997610/47a8bbcaa009eec69540e96a2b9e4540a294a618/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788252587", "website": "https://www.bloodyduke.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2120 or AMD Athlon II X3 450<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4400 or AMD Radeon R5<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Anything to hear the mighty roar of Erinyes' Fury<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A system meeting the minimum requirements will be able to play the game on Low settings at 720p@30fps.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Anything to hear the mighty roar of Erinyes' Fury<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A system meeting the recommended requirements will be able to play the game on Ultra settings at 1440p@60fps.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"b